# GS19: from the kolima_glade save (Kolima Forest's cliff, from the glade; continue with vale_day1_continue.keys +
# --flash-in). Round to the river log's east side (22,17); walking west rolls it three cells to column 16 (stopped by the
# west-east log on row 17); in through column 19, round the north (12,11) to its west side (15,16): walking east rolls it
# back to column 20; below the west-east log (14,18) walking north rolls it to row 15; from 16,20 walking south rolls the
# other west-east log a row (the way out south); round by the south and east to the river log's east side (21,16):
# walking west rolls it to column 12, where it tips into the river (KolimaForestCliff_PushLog); over it west, north up
# the west bank, west along the slope (5,10) and north onto the cliff top, east along it to the exit (31,6): Kolima
# Forest's floodgate (f8972). Battles by autowalk's A taps.
